## Original Content
Глава региона Владимир Сальдо отметил, что аграрии работают в тяжелой обстановке

## Summary
Attacks by the Ukrainian Armed Forces (AFU) in the Kherson region have destroyed 170 hectares of crops. Regional head Vladimir Saldo noted that farmers are working in extremely difficult conditions amid the ongoing hostilities.

## Key Points
- Ukrainian Armed Forces attacks destroyed 170 hectares of sown crops in the Kherson region
- Regional governor Vladimir Saldo confirmed the agricultural losses
- Farmers in the region are operating under severely strained conditions due to the conflict


